.list-group-item{style: 'padding-top:0'}
  .row.bg-danger{style: 'margin-bottom: 10px;'}
    .col-12{style:'padding: 5px;'}
      Hello Pilots! XcTrack is having busiest flying season ever. This means our costs have gone up faster than a summer thermal.
      %strong
        I need your help keeping the site up and running.
      If you use XcTrack,
      %a{style:'color:#428bca;text-decoration:underline', href: 'https://ko-fi.com/alexneigher', target: '_blank'}
        please consider donating here.
      If I am unable to meet the costs, I will be sunsetting XcTrack within the next few months.

  .row
    .col-xs-6
      #updateMapButton.btn.btn-primary.btn-block{onclick: "$('#pilot-names form').submit();", class: (' disabled' unless @users_on_map.any?)}
        Show Map

    .col-xs-6
      %select.form-control{onchange: "pickGroup($(this));"}
        %option{selected: 'selected', data: {url: root_path } }
          = "All Groups"

        - Group.order(name: :asc).includes(:users).each do |group|
          - next if group.users.empty?
          %option{selected: ('selected' if group.id == params[:id].to_i ), data: {url:group_path(group)} }
            = "#{group.name} (#{group.users.length} pilots)"

        %option{data: {url: new_group_path}}
          = "New Group"


:javascript
    function pickGroup(el){
      var $this = el
      var data = $this.find(':selected').data('url');
      location.assign(data)
    }